## portus.middleware — middlewares listos para usar.
##
## Cada `add_*` registra un middleware en la aplicación; el orden de llamada es
## el de registro. Todos son "de antes": se ejecutan antes de la ruta y pueden
## cortar la petición respondiendo y marcando el contexto como enviado.
##
## ## Ejemplo
## ```pengu
## calling portus.middleware.add_request_id with sigil of app
## calling portus.middleware.add_security_headers with sigil of app
## calling portus.middleware.add_cors with sigil of app, "https://midominio.example"
## ```
##
## ## Memoria
## La configuración se aloja en la arena de la aplicación; no la liberes.
import std.arena as arena_module
import std.spark
import portus.application as application_module
import portus.context as context_module
import portus.error
import portus.handler as handler_module
import portus.native as native_module
import portus.text

## Configuración del middleware CORS.
rune CorsConfig:
    ## Origen permitido (`"*"` permite cualquiera).
    origin as string

## Añade `X-Request-Id` con 16 bytes aleatorios en hexadecimal (32 chars).
##
## ## Memoria
## No aloja configuración.
weave add_request_id with app as ref to application_module.Application into void:
    calling application_module.use with app, calling handler_module.middleware with _request_id

## Middleware que pone `X-Request-Id`.
weave _request_id with data as ref to void, context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to HttpError:
    var id as ref to frozen char is calling native_module.portus_native_request_id
    if (transmute id to usize) != 0:
        var copy as string is calling text.from_cstr with id
        calling context.set_header with "X-Request-Id", copy
        banish copy
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

## Añade las cabeceras de seguridad habituales.
##
## `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`, `X-Frame-Options: DENY`,
## `Referrer-Policy: no-referrer` y `Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin`.
weave add_security_headers with app as ref to application_module.Application into void:
    calling application_module.use with app, calling handler_module.middleware with _security_headers

## Middleware de cabeceras de seguridad.
weave _security_headers with data as ref to void, context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to HttpError:
    calling context.set_header with "X-Content-Type-Options", "nosniff"
    calling context.set_header with "X-Frame-Options", "DENY"
    calling context.set_header with "Referrer-Policy", "no-referrer"
    calling context.set_header with "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy", "same-origin"
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

antiquus _raw_cors with config as ref to CorsConfig into ref to void:
    r"""
return (void *)config;
"""

## Añade CORS para `origin`.
##
## Responde los preflight (`OPTIONS` con `Access-Control-Request-Method`) con
## `204` y las cabeceras `Access-Control-Allow-*`.
##
## ## Memoria
## `origin` se copia en la arena de la aplicación.
weave add_cors with app as ref to application_module.Application, origin as string into void:
    var arena as ref to arena_module.Arena is calling application_module.arena_of with app
    var config as ref to CorsConfig is calling arena_module.arena_alloc_one of CorsConfig with arena
    set config->origin is "{origin}"
    calling application_module.use with app, calling handler_module.middleware_with with _cors, calling _raw_cors with config

## Middleware que aplica la configuración CORS.
weave _cors with data as ref to void, context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to HttpError:
    var config as ref to CorsConfig is transmute data to ref to CorsConfig
    calling context.set_header with "Access-Control-Allow-Origin", config->origin
    calling context.set_header with "Vary", "Origin"
    let wants_preflight as maybe string is calling context.header with "Access-Control-Request-Method"
    if (calling context.method) == "OPTIONS" and wants_preflight.is_present:
        calling context.set_header with "Access-Control-Allow-Methods", "GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, HEAD, OPTIONS"
        calling context.set_header with "Access-Control-Allow-Headers", "Content-Type, Authorization"
        calling context.set_header with "Access-Control-Max-Age", "600"
        calling context.send_status with 204, ""
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

## Registra un log de una línea por petición en `stdout`.
##
## Antes de la ruta imprime `-> METODO ruta`; al terminar, `<- codigo Nms`.
weave add_logger with app as ref to application_module.Application into void:
    calling application_module.use with app, calling handler_module.middleware with _log_before
    calling application_module.after with app, calling handler_module.middleware with _log_after

## Middleware que abre la línea de log.
weave _log_before with data as ref to void, context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to HttpError:
    var line as string is "-> {calling context.method} {calling context.path}"
    calling spark.println with line
    banish line
    return calling handler_module.ok_void

## Finisher que cierra la línea de log con código y duración.
weave _log_after with data as ref to void, context as ref to context_module.Context into result of void to HttpError:
    var now as long is calling native_module.portus_native_now_ms
    var elapsed as int is ((now - context->started_ms) to int)
    var code as int is calling context.status_code
    var line as string is "<- {code} {elapsed}ms"
    calling spark.println with line
    banish line
    return calling handler_module.ok_void
